+      <p class="nav-label resources-label">深入了解</p><nav aria-label="官方资源"><a href="https://just.systems/man/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">完整手册 <span class="external">↗</span></a><a href="https://just.systems/man/en/command-line-options.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">命令行选项 <span class="external">↗</span></a><a href="https://github.com/casey/just/discussions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">社区讨论 <span class="external">↗</span></a></nav></div>
+      <div class="sidebar-bottom"><span class="status-dot"></span> 开源，让工作更简单。<a href="https://github.com/casey/just/blob/master/LICENSE">CC0-1.0 许可证 ↗</a></div>
+    </aside>
+    <main id="main">
+      <div class="breadcrumb">文档 <span>/</span> 开始使用 <span>/</span> <b>快速上手</b></div>
+      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> 少记命令，多做事情</div>
+      <h1>从这里，开始 just。</h1>
+      <p class="intro measure-prose">把冗长的命令收进一个文件，用简单的名字运行它们。<br class="desktop-break">只需几分钟，让项目里的日常任务井井有条。</p>
+      <div class="hero-meta"><span><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="7"/><path d="M10 6v4l3 2"/></svg>约 5 分钟</span><span><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7 5-5 5 5 5m6-10 5 5-5 5"/></svg>面向命令行使用者</span><span class="meta-tag">跨平台</span></div>
+      <div class="overview"><span class="overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">❯_</span><p><strong>一个 justfile，统一项目入口。</strong><br>just 是一个命令运行器。安装一次，在每个项目中复用你的工作习惯。</p></div>
+
+      <section id="install" class="doc-section">
+        <div class="section-heading"><span class="step-number">01</span><h2>安装 just</h2><span class="section-line"></span></div>
+        <p class="measure-prose">选择你的操作系统，在终端中执行安装命令。</p>
+        <div class="install-box">
+          <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="选择操作系统"><button role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="install-panel" id="tab-mac" data-platform="mac">macOS</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="install-panel" id="tab-linux" tabindex="-1" data-platform="linux">Linux</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="install-panel" id="tab-windows" tabindex="-1" data-platform="windows">Windows</button><span id="package-manager">Homebrew</span></div>
+          <div id="install-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-mac" tabindex="0"><div class="code-single"><span class="prompt" aria-hidden="true">$</span><code id="install-command">brew install just</code><button class="copy-button" data-copy="install-command" aria-label="复制安装命令">复制 <span aria-hidden="true">⧉</span></button></div></div>
+        </div>
+        <p class="hint" id="platform-hint">需要先安装 Homebrew。其他安装方式见<a href="https://just.systems/man/en/packages.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官方安装指南 ↗</a>。</p>
+        <div class="verify"><span class="check-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><p>安装后运行 <code>just --version</code>，显示版本号即表示安装成功。</p></div>
+      </section>
+
+      <section id="configure" class="doc-section">
+        <div class="section-heading"><span class="step-number">02</span><h2>配置你的项目</h2><span class="section-line"></span></div>
+        <p class="measure-prose">在项目根目录新建 <code>justfile</code>，给常用任务起个简短的名字。<br>以下以已有的 Node.js 项目为例，需已配置 <code>dev</code> 和 <code>test</code> 脚本。</p>
+        <div class="code-block"><div class="code-header"><span><span class="file-icon" aria-hidden="true">▤</span> justfile</span><button class="copy-button" data-copy="config-code" aria-label="复制 justfile 配置">复制 <span aria-hidden="true">⧉</span></button></div><pre><code id="config-code"><span class="code-comment"># 启动开发服务</span>
+<span class="code-key">dev</span>:
+    npm run dev
+
+<span class="code-comment"># 运行项目测试</span>
+<span class="code-key">test</span>:
+    npm test</code></pre></div>
+        <div class="note"><span class="info-icon" aria-hidden="true">i</span><p><strong>小提示</strong><br>每个任务的命令需要缩进，示例使用 4 个空格。just 会从当前目录向上查找 justfile，在项目子目录中也能运行。</p></div>
+      </section>
+
+      <section id="commands" class="doc-section">
+        <div class="section-heading"><span class="step-number">03</span><h2>记住这三个命令</h2><span class="section-line"></span></div>
+        <p class="measure-prose">保存配置后，在项目目录打开终端，试试你的新工作流。</p>
+        <div class="command-list">
+          <article class="command-row"><div class="command-description"><span class="command-index">01 /</span><div><h3>查看可用任务</h3><p>列出任务名称和注释，随时查阅。</p></div></div><div class="command-snippet"><code id="command-list">just --list</code><button data-copy="command-list" class="copy-icon" aria-label="复制 just --list">⧉</button></div></article>
+          <article class="command-row"><div class="command-description"><span class="command-index">02 /</span><div><h3>启动开发服务</h3><p>运行配置中的 dev 任务。</p></div></div><div class="command-snippet"><code id="command-dev">just dev</code><button data-copy="command-dev" class="copy-icon" aria-label="复制 just dev">⧉</button></div></article>
+          <article class="command-row"><div class="command-description"><span class="command-index">03 /</span><div><h3>运行项目测试</h3><p>运行配置中的 test 任务。</p></div></div><div class="command-snippet"><code id="command-test">just test</code><button data-copy="command-test" class="copy-icon" aria-label="复制 just test">⧉</button></div></article>
+        </div>
+        <p class="hint">dev 和 test 是本页配置的任务名，你也可以按项目需要自行命名。</p>
+      </section>
+      <a class="next-card" href="https://just.systems/man/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><div><span class="next-label">接下来</span><h3>让工作流再进一步</h3><p>探索任务参数、依赖关系与环境变量。</p></div><span class="next-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
+      <footer class="article-footer"><span>just · 社区中文快速指南</span><a href="https://just.systems/man/en/quick-start.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">参考官方文档 ↗</a></footer>
+    </main>
+    <aside class="toc"><p class="nav-label">本页内容</p><nav aria-label="本页目录"><a class="active" href="#install">安装 just</a><a href="#configure">配置你的项目</a><a href="#commands">三个常用命令</a></nav><div class="toc-note"><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><p>好工具，<br>从简单开始。</p><span class="toc-note-small">A handy command runner.</span></div></aside>
